    "jobDescription": "Join Deloitte China Deloitte China provides integrated professional services to our clients with a one-stop shop offering of world-leading audit, tax, and consulting services. • We are the world's largest professional services firm that changes the world, leading with purpose and shared values. • We are market leader in digital and innovative solutions, creating value for client through our multi-disciplinary services. • We are certified as one of the ‘Best Workplaces™ in Greater China and recognized as a Top Employer in China by the Top Employers Institute* since 2006！ Consulting provides enduring value to the world's most important organizations. With 7000+ consulting and delivery practitioners, Deloitte consulting delivers innovative solutions through Strategy, Risk & Transactions and Technology & Transformation. Across disciplines, we connect the optimal mix of Deloitte's industry, functional and technology capabilities with the best of our Alliances to orchestrate the outcomes our clients seek. We aspire to be our clients' Most Valuable Partner, with our people, platforms and AI integral to creating shared value at the heart of their business. Work you’ll do: Enterprise Risk & Transformation • Support organizations in solving complex business challenges through enterprise risk, governance and business transformation solutions. • Help clients strengthen decision-making, organizational resilience and operational effectiveness by combining risk insights with practical business solutions. AI Governance & Trustworthy AI • Support organizations in adopting AI responsibly by assessing AI governance, Trustworthy AI principles and AI-related business risks. • Assist clients in designing governance frameworks, internal controls and risk management approaches for AI-enabled business processes. AI-enabled Consulting & Data Analytics • Leverage AI, data analytics and intelligent research methodologies to generate business insights and enhance consulting delivery. • Apply AI-enabled tools and digital technologies to improve knowledge management, research efficiency and client value creation. Global Business & C2G Transformation • Support Chinese enterprises in expanding globally and multinational companies operating in China by addressing evolving regulatory, operational and strategic risks. • Participate in cross-border projects covering international expansion, regulatory compliance, operating model transformation and supply chain resilience. Third Party & Ecosystem Risk • Support organizations in managing risks across their business ecosystem, including suppliers, distributors, healthcare stakeholders, strategic partners and outsourced service providers. • Perform third-party risk assessments and help clients strengthen governance across their business ecosystem. Business Process & Operational Excellence • Perform business process assessments and develop practical solutions that improve operational efficiency, governance and organizational performance. • Support organizations in identifying opportunities to optimize processes, strengthen internal controls and improve business effectiveness. Industry Solutions • Gain exposure to projects across diverse industries, including Life Sciences & Healthcare, Automotive, Commercial Products and Energy, helping clients address industry-specific business challenges. • Develop industry knowledge while working alongside experienced practitioners to solve complex client issues. You are also expected to: • Demonstrate curiosity towards emerging technologies, AI and evolving business models. • Embrace continuous learning and adapt quickly in a rapidly changing business environment. • Think critically, challenge assumptions and translate complex information into practical business insights. • Develop strong analytical, communication and stakeholder management skills. • Collaborate effectively across industries, functions and geographies to deliver integrated client solutions. • Demonstrate ownership, accountability and integrity in everything you do. • Contribute innovative ideas that improve consulting methodologies, client experiences and team capabilities. • Build trusted relationships through effective communication, collaboration and professionalism. • Understand how your work contributes to the priorities of the team, our clients and the broader business. During your tenure as an analyst in Enterprise Risk, you will demonstrate and develop your leadership and professional capabilities in the following areas: Building diverse capability, Collaborating, Creating purpose, Delivering value, Driving agility, Influencing, Inspiring, Building the Business, Analytical Acumen, Effective Communication, Delivery Excellence, Managing Change, Strategic Thinking & Problem Solving and Tech Savviness",
